<title>USA: Station's Kansas City casino approved.</title>
<headline>Station's Kansas City casino approved.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Station Casinos Inc said Wednesday it received approval from the Missouri Gaming Commission to operate Station Casino Kansas City Hotel &amp; Casino.</p>
<p>The company said it planned to open the facility on Thursday.</p>
</text>
